# Container application logs. 181 MB of the 2.1 GB arr-config pair, regenerable, and
# rewritten continuously by running containers - which made them unbackupable rather than
# merely wasteful: on 2026-09-06 rclone spent an hour on retry 1 of 5 with 60 x
# "corrupted on transfer: sizes differ" because the source kept moving under it.
# They would also land as changed content in EVERY restic snapshot, making dedup on
# tech-priest-02 look far worse than it is. Both destinations read this file, so this is
# one decision for both.
logs/**
logs.db
